WallElementWidth [SimTalk]
Sets the width of an entire individual element of the factory walls designated by <Path>.
Remarks
Assigning the attribute deactivates graphic inheritance.
You cannot assign the attribute when the graphic is an automatically generated graphic group or when the
graphic is located in an automatically generated graphic group.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.WallElementWidth:length
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type length.
Example
MyStation.getGraphic("default").createFactoryWalls([11,40,3], 
42cm).WallElementWidth := 150cm
print MyStation.getGraphic("default").createFactoryWalls([11,40,3], 
42cm).WallElementWidth
See also
Insert Shape > Factory Walls
Factory Walls Settings
createFactoryWalls [SimTalk]
