ProfileMaterialShininess [SimTalk]
Sets the shininess of the profile material of the fence designated by <Path>.
Remarks
You can only access the attribute if the material is active.
Assigning the attribute deactivates graphic inheritance.
You cannot assign the attribute when the graphic is an automatically generated graphic group or when the
graphic is located in an automatically generated graphic group.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.ProfileMaterialShininess:real
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type real between 0 and 1.
Example
.Models.MyModel._3D.getGraphic("deco", [5]).ProfileMaterialShininess := 0.7
See also
Insert Shape > Fence
Fence Settings
createFence [SimTalk]
ProfileMaterialActive [SimTalk]
